{"1859480296804004233":{"a":"<p>Yes, yes they do. ITAR materials are controlled unclassified as &quot;Not releasable to Foreign Nationals&quot; or NOFORN. Are you a permanent resident of the US? Then you have NOFORN clearance. How do you know your material is NOFORN? Does it include the word &quot;space&quot; or &quot;weapon&quot; anywhere?… <a href=\"https://x.com/space_jm_/status/1859045253518372866\">Tweet by @space_jm_</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/space_jm_/status/1859045253518372866\">https://x.com/space_jm_/status/1859045253518372866</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1859480296804004233</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1859480296804004233\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-21T06:13:44Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>3</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1859480296804004233</dd>\n</dl>"},"1859481145508802566":{"a":"<p>Protip: One can pretty easily avoid ITAR regulations by replacing the word &quot;Space&quot; with &quot;High altitude&quot; and &quot;weapon&quot; with &quot;toy.&quot; 😂😳 It&#x27;s a high altitude LARP toy. See, here&#x27;s where you put the floaty juice and this is where the sparks come out. 🤷‍♂️</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\" data-conversation=\"none\" data-dnt=\"true\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1859480296804004233\">https://x.com/i/status/1859480296804004233</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1859481145508802566</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1859481145508802566\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2024-11-21T06:17:07Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>2</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>3</dd><d